# Line endings are normalized to LF in the repository, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a checkout on Windows writes CRLF, Prettier reads CRLF as a
# formatting difference, and `bun run check` reports every file in the tree as
# unformatted — which makes the command useless and so nobody runs it. The
# working tree is left alone; only what Git stores is normalized.
* text=auto eol=lf
